  "instructions_to_main_agent": [
    "Follow this file strictly. Build the app using React Native components (.js/.tsx compatible) within the existing Expo project.",
    "Implement the 3 distinct roles (Siswa, Guru, Wali Murid) seamlessly switchable from the login screen and header profile.",
    "Include Quick-Fill Demo Chips below the login button for one-tap role testing: 'Siswa: Ahmad Fauzan', 'Guru: Budi Santoso, S.Pd.', 'Wali: Ortu Ahmad Fauzan'.",
    "Keep navigation native and clean. When in student mode, provide standard bottom navigation (Beranda, Form Harian, Riwayat, Profil).",
    "In teacher mode, render the KPI summary cards, filter pills (Semua, Belum Mengisi, Sudah), search bar, student list, and detail modal/screen.",
    "Implement the 5-step form wizard with smooth step indicator, easy touch chips (minimum 44px touch target), and instant feedback.",
    "Incorporate the Indonesian Islamic-modern school aesthetic: Forest Emerald (#047857), Sage (#D1FAE5), Golden Ochre (#D97706), Soft Slate (#F8FAFC).",
    "All interactive elements MUST have valid 'testID' attributes matching the kebab-case schema specified in testIds.",
    "Make sure the UI is 100% in Bahasa Indonesia as requested by the user."
  ],
